sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Demo<br/>page and server
  participant C as Claude Code<br/>agent session
  participant M as Claude model<br/>Anthropic API
  box rgba(0, 95, 158, 0.08) Substrate, all on this Mac
    participant X as Substrate MCP<br/>one per session
    participant S as Substrate server<br/>:3100
    participant O as Ollama<br/>bge-m3
    participant D as Postgres<br/>+ pgvector
  end

  Note over P,D: Writing a memory. The demo's ingest calls the server directly, and an agent does the same through the MCP.
  P->>S: mutate: create a Decision
  S->>D: Insert the row, fields checked against its type
  S->>D: Update the keyword index
  S->>O: Embed the row's text
  O-->>S: Vector
  S->>D: Store the vector
  S-->>P: Created and searchable

  Note over P,D: Answering "What is the current storage engine for Ledger billing pipeline?"
  P->>S: schema
  S-->>P: Types and fields
  P->>C: Question, Substrate tools, schema overview
  C->>X: Start
  C->>M: Question and tool definitions
  M-->>C: Call the recall tool, asking for the decisions' fields
  C->>X: Tool call
  X->>S: recall
  S->>O: Embed the question
  O-->>S: Vector
  S->>D: Vector search and keyword search
  D-->>S: Matching rows
  S-->>X: Rows fused by rank, with the fields asked for
  X-->>C: 3 decisions: 1 active, 2 replaced
  C->>M: Tool result
  M-->>C: "ClickHouse"
  C-->>P: Answer and every call, streamed
  Note over C,D: Filter, count and join questions call the query tool instead: one typed query, answered by Postgres alone, with no embedding.
